    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=623199205665538858&sectionId=623199205800018730)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnqoYha09X_text","label":"ggnqoYha09X_text","default":"FAQs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_0","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_0","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Isn't 200mg of NMN underdosed? I've read about people taking a gram a day.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_1","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_1","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Why is it $499 when I could buy Urolithin A, NMN and collagen separately for less?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_2","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_2","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Doesn't collagen just break down into amino acids and do nothing?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_3","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_3","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>What if I take it for three months and feel nothing?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_4","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_4","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>How do I know what's actually in it? I'm done with proprietary blends.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_5","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_5","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Am I going to get trapped in a subscription I can't cancel?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_6","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_6","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Where is it made? I worry about heavy metals and \"made-in-China\" supplements.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_7","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_7","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Do I still need my greens powder or multivitamin?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_8","label":"ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_8","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>How do I actually take it?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0imPH4f8x_text","label":"gg0imPH4f8x_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">A fair question — and the answer is about balance, not just size. NMN raises NAD+, but it also burns through your methyl groups as it works, which is exactly why big, unbalanced doses so often stop feeling like anything after a few weeks (and can disrupt your sleep). AgeAura pairs 200mg NMN with 100mg TMG — the methyl donor most brands skip — at a ratio built to keep that balance, so it keeps working instead of plateauing. We'd rather give you a clinically-conservative dose that holds than a megadose that fizzles by week three.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0pKIsFcYy_text","label":"gg0pKIsFcYy_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Because \"separately\" means three orders, three brands to vet, three sets of unknown purity — and you'd still be missing the cofactors that make them work: the TMG that keeps NMN from plateauing, the vitamin C collagen needs to rebuild. The Protocol brings all three at full clinical dose, cofactors included, every milligram third-party verified, in one ritual — plus a 90-day money-back guarantee you'll never get on a cheap Amazon bottle. You're not paying for more powder. You're paying for the doses being real and the guesswork being gone.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6gKSwIgdP_text","label":"gg6gKSwIgdP_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">It's the most repeated myth in the category. Specific collagen dipeptides (like Pro-Hyp) survive digestion and signal your body to rebuild — but only when the cofactor is present, because collagen physically cannot be synthesized without vitamin C, which most powders leave out. AgeAura's Longevity Peptides include the full 5,000mg dose plus the vitamin C and hyaluronic acid it actually needs to become collagen. That's the line between \"expensive pee\" and nails, joints and skin you can feel change.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH9TD5KuYK_text","label":"ggH9TD5KuYK_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Two things. First, set the expectation: Urolithin A isn't a stimulant — it's structural. You won't feel a buzz; you'll notice the recovery score on your watch moving, the soreness easing, the nap you stop needing. It's the one longevity compound with a landmark human trial behind it (Singh, JAMA 2022: ~12% muscle strength at 16 weeks), and like that trial, it works quietly over months. Second — you don't have to take our word for it. If you don't feel a meaningful shift in 90 days, email us for a full refund and keep the product. The risk is entirely ours.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbIHI8nJ8Y_text","label":"ggbIHI8nJ8Y_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">So are we. There's no blend to hide behind: every compound and every milligram is printed on the label — 200mg NMN, 100mg TMG, 500mg Urolithin A, 5,000mg collagen — and every batch is verified by an independent third-party lab. If a brand won't show you its COA, that tells you everything you need to know. We'll show you ours.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC77MqxIcb_text","label":"ggC77MqxIcb_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">No. There's no forced subscription — you buy when you want to, full stop. No auto-ship that arrives after you've cancelled, no \"email us three times\" runaround. And every protocol is backed by a 90-day money-back guarantee: if it doesn't work for you, you get a full refund and keep the product. No restocking fees, no returns at your expense.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg37qa2H3XO_text","label":"gg37qa2H3XO_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Every batch is manufactured in a US cGMP-registered facility and tested by an independent third-party lab for identity, potency and heavy metals before it ships — and the certificate is available for you to read. No proprietary blends, no mystery sourcing. Purity you can verify, not just trust.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga7q5YJjuo_text","label":"gga7q5YJjuo_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">They do different jobs. A greens powder or multivitamin fills the nutrient gaps in your diet — foundational nutrition. The Pure Protocol targets the three mechanisms of aging — cellular energy, mitochondrial cleanup, and structural collagen — which greens powders don't touch. Keep your greens if you love them; the Protocol stacks right on top as the longevity layer.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAFLXgVwrb_text","label":"ggAFLXgVwrb_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Thirty seconds, once a day. One Pure NMN + TMG capsule, one Pure Urolithin A capsule, and one flavorless Longevity Peptides stick stirred into your coffee, matcha or water. No shaker, no pill organizer, no 14-capsule morning.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/21._Ltc_AAR_footer_image_e899d7f3-7542-4c3b-a546-5bf184a399b7.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://placehold.co/1088x1088?text=Image"}],
